    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Snackable hero experience!]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including a city roamed by zombies, a western street corner crossed by bullets, and a samurai battle through the four seasons, there are many situations available, This game is 2D action game to enjoy feeling like a hero or a monster in a short time &amp; easily!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are 8 types of situations + \u03b1 &amp; 20+ playable characters!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By completing each situation, bonus characters will be unlocked, and eventually 20+ characters will be available to enjoy. Some characters have overwhelming power, so you can experience the experience of knocking down your enemies! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The combination depends on your mood!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have cleared a situation, you can use all unlocked characters. Cowboys vs. Ninjas, Pirates vs. Zombies, Samurai vs. Space Monsters, Shark vs. Villains - the combination depends on your mood!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy difficulty!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The overall difficulty level is low so that you can enjoy the feeling of being a hero. However, enemy bosses in each situation will attack you with their own unique attacks. Watch their movements and defeat them calmly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No difficult storyline.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although the objective in each situation is presented, there is no storyline that interferes with the play. &quot;Today I'm going to be a cowboy and fight pirates!&quot; If you decide to be a that's the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The new situation &amp; new character update [Dinosaur Update] has been launched!</strong> On July 31, 2025, a new situation themed around dinosaurs and new playable characters will be added!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The new situation and new character addition update [Gladiator Update] has been released!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A new situation themed around gladiators and new playable characters will be added on 2/14/2025!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please look forward to future updates</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plans are underway to add new stages and playable characters in post-launch updates to ensure that you can enjoy the game for a long time. Stay tuned for more information!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Snackable hero experience!]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including a city roamed by zombies, a western street corner crossed by bullets, and a samurai battle through the four seasons, there are many situations available, This game is 2D action game to enjoy feeling like a hero or a monster in a short time &amp; easily!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are 8 types of situations + \u03b1 &amp; 20+ playable characters!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By completing each situation, bonus characters will be unlocked, and eventually 20+ characters will be available to enjoy. Some characters have overwhelming power, so you can experience the experience of knocking down your enemies! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The combination depends on your mood!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have cleared a situation, you can use all unlocked characters. Cowboys vs. Ninjas, Pirates vs. Zombies, Samurai vs. Space Monsters, Shark vs. Villains - the combination depends on your mood!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy difficulty!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The overall difficulty level is low so that you can enjoy the feeling of being a hero. However, enemy bosses in each situation will attack you with their own unique attacks. Watch their movements and defeat them calmly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No difficult storyline.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although the objective in each situation is presented, there is no storyline that interferes with the play. &quot;Today I'm going to be a cowboy and fight pirates!&quot; If you decide to be a that's the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The new situation &amp; new character update [Dinosaur Update] has been launched!</strong> On July 31, 2025, a new situation themed around dinosaurs and new playable characters will be added!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The new situation and new character addition update [Gladiator Update] has been released!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A new situation themed around gladiators and new playable characters will be added on 2/14/2025!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please look forward to future updates</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plans are underway to add new stages and playable characters in post-launch updates to ensure that you can enjoy the game for a long time. Stay tuned for more information!</p>",
    "short_description": "[Snackable hero experience!]Zombies in the city, a western street corner, a samurai battle... Snack time action game is a 2D action game where you can easily enjoy feeling like a hero or a monster in various situations! 7 types of situations + \u03b1&amp;20+ playable characters! The combination is up to you!",
